<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="container hero-inner"><div class="pill"><span class="dot"></span> AI-NATIVE EDUCATION TECHNOLOGY · TOKYO</div><h1>Smarter education.<br><span class="gradient">More human learning.</span></h1><p class="hero-p">We are building practical AI-powered tools that make teaching easier, language practice more engaging, and learning progress clearer — so educators can focus on what matters most.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#solutions">Explore our solutions <span class="small-arrow">→</span></a><a class="btn btn-white" href="#about">Discover our mission <span class="small-arrow">↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-meta">Bright Education JSC. · Products and interfaces shown are development concepts</div>
